This is a CP6-maintained derivative, not an unmodified upstream release or an
endorsement by Sigstore. Upstream cryptographic source is unchanged. CP6 updates
the Go toolchain to 1.26.8 and these dependency versions:
golang.org/x/crypto 0.55.0; golang.org/x/mod 0.40.0; golang.org/x/net 0.58.0;
golang.org/x/sync 0.22.0; golang.org/x/sys 0.47.0; golang.org/x/term 0.45.0;
golang.org/x/text 0.41.0; golang.org/x/tools 0.49.0; google.golang.org/grpc 1.83.2.

Both builds use CGO_ENABLED=0 and do not include the optional PIV/PKCS11 build
tags. P10 uses file/environment-backed P-256 keys, not these hardware backends.
Version metadata identifies the modified tree and fixes buildDate to the
upstream source commit time for reproducibility; it is not the compilation time.

The build recipe, reviewed lock files, output hashes and audit record are in
the GTX537/CP6 repository under eng/p10/cosign and docs/superpowers/plans.
